      <v n="1">
 Jacob (Israel) traveled to Egypt with his sons. Each son had his own family with him. These are the sons of Israel: </v>
      <v n="2">
 Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, </v>
      <v n="3">
 Issachar, Zebulun, Benjamin, </v>
      <v n="4">
 Dan, Naphtali, Gad, Asher. </v>
