      <v n="3">
 Samuel told the people of Israel, “If you are really coming back to the Lord—with all your heart—then you must throw away your foreign gods. You must throw away your idols of Ashtoreth. [83] And you must give yourselves fully to the Lord. You must serve only the Lord! Then the Lord will save you from the Philistines.” </v>
      <v n="4">
 So the Israelites threw away their statues of Baal [84] and Ashtoreth. [85] The Israelites served only the Lord. </v>
