 from the towns of Lod, Hadid,
and Ono721
 </v>
      <v n="38">
 from the town of Senaah3,930
 </v>
      <v n="39">
 These are the priests: </v>
      <v n="40">
 the descendants of Immer1,052
 </v>
      <v n="41">
 the descendants of Pashhur1,247
 </v>
      <v n="42">
 the descendants of Harim1,017
 </v>
      <v n="43">
 These are the people from the family group of Levi: </v>
      <v n="44">
 These are the singers: </v>
      <v n="45">
 These are the gatekeepers: </v>
      <v n="46">
 These are the special temple servants: </v>
      <v n="47">
 Keros, Sia, Padon,
 </v>
      <v n="48">
 Lebana, Hagaba, Shalmai,
 </v>
      <v n="49">
 Hanan, Giddel, Gaher,
 </v>
