God All-Powerful will always be fair.
 </v>
      <v n="13">
 No person chose God to be
in charge over the earth.
No one gave God responsibility
for the whole world.
{God created everything
and he has always been in control.}
 </v>
      <v n="14">
 If God decided to take his spirit
and his breath of life away from people,
 </v>
      <v n="15">
 then all the people on earth would die.
All people would become dust again.
 </v>
      <v n="16">
 “If you men are wise,
then you will listen to what I say.
 </v>
      <v n="17">
 A person that hates to be fair
