And God hears that cry for help.
 </v>
      <v n="29">
 But if God decides not to help them,
then no person can judge God guilty.
If God hides himself from people,
then no person can find him.
God is the ruler over people and nations.
 </v>
      <v n="30">
 And if a ruler causes people to sin,
then God will remove him from power.
 </v>
      <v n="31">
 That will happen unless he says to God,
