I won’t sin any more.
 </v>
      <v n="32">
 God, even if I can’t see {you},
please teach me
{the right way to live}.
If I have done wrong,
I won’t do it again.’
 </v>
      <v n="33">
 “Job, you want God to reward you.
But you refuse to change.
Job, it is your decision, not mine.
Tell me what you think.
 </v>
      <v n="34">
 A wise person would listen to me.
A wise person would say,
 </v>
      <v n="35">
 ‘Job talks like an ignorant person.
