 </v>
      <v n="14">
 “Job, stop for a minute and listen.
Think about the wonderful things
God does.
 </v>
      <v n="15">
 Job, do you know how God
controls the clouds?
Do you know how God
makes his lightning flash?
 </v>
      <v n="16">
 Do you know how the clouds
hang in the sky?
Clouds are just one example
