 </v>
      <v n="23">
 God All-Powerful is great!
We can’t understand God!
God is very powerful,
but he is also good and fair to us.
God doesn’t want to hurt us!
 </v>
      <v n="24">
 That is why people respect God.
But God doesn’t respect proud people
