 </v>
      <v n="28">
 Does the rain have a father?
Who produces the drops of dew?
 </v>
      <v n="29">
 Does ice have a mother?
Who gives birth to the hail?
 </v>
      <v n="30">
 Water freezes as hard as a rock.
