 </v>
      <v n="23">
 The soldier’s quiver [91] shakes
on the horse’s side.
The spear and weapons his rider carries
shine in the sun.
 </v>
      <v n="24">
 The horse is very excited!
He runs fast over the ground. [92] 
When the horse hears the trumpet blow
he can’t stand still.
 </v>
      <v n="25">
 When the trumpet sounds,
the horse shouts, ‘hurray!’
He smells the battle from far away.
He hears the commanders shouting orders
and all the other sounds of the battle.
 </v>
      <v n="26">
 “Job, did you teach the hawk
