 </v>
      <v n="15">
 “Job, look at the behemoth. [97] 
I (God) made the behemoth
and I made you.
The behemoth eats grass like a cow.
 </v>
      <v n="16">
 The behemoth has much strength
in his body.
The muscles in his stomach are very powerful.
 </v>
      <v n="17">
 The behemoth’s tail stands strong
like a cedar tree.
His leg muscles are very strong.
 </v>
      <v n="18">
 The behemoth’s bones are strong
