Be happy!
 </v>
      <v n="4">
 Go to the Lord for strength.
Always go to him for help.
 </v>
      <v n="5">
 Remember the amazing things he does.
Remember his miracles and wise decisions.
 </v>
      <v n="6">
 You are descendants [546] of his servant Abraham.
You are descendants of Jacob,
the man God chose.
 </v>
      <v n="7">
 The Lord is our God.
The Lord rules the whole world. [547] 
 </v>
      <v n="8">
 Remember God’s Agreement [548] forever.
