 </v>
      <v n="33">
 God changed rivers into a desert.
God stopped springs from flowing.
 </v>
      <v n="34">
 God changed the fertile land
and it became worthless salty land.
Why? Because of the bad people
who were living in that place.
 </v>
      <v n="35">
 God changed the desert
and it became a land with pools of water.
God caused springs of water to flow
from dry ground.
 </v>
      <v n="36">
 God led hungry people to that good land.
