 The skies will be dark. The sun, the moon, and the stars will not shine. </v>
      <v n="11">
 {God says,} “I will cause bad things to happen to the world. I will punish the evil people for their sin. I will cause the proud people to lose their pride. I will stop the bragging of the people that are mean to others. </v>
