    <c n="14">
      <v n="1">
 {In the future,} the Lord will again show his love to Jacob. The Lord will again choose the people of Israel. {At that time,} the Lord will give those people their land. Then non-Jewish people [146] will join themselves to the Jewish people. Both people will join and become one family—Jacob’s family. </v>
