 Those nations will take the people of Israel back to Israel’s land. Those men and women from the other nations will become slaves to Israel. {In the past,} those people forced the people of Israel to become their slaves. But {at this time,} the people of Israel will defeat those nations and Israel will then rule over them. </v>
