      <v n="12">
 At that time, the Lord will begin separating his people from others. He will begin at the Euphrates River. [253] The Lord will gather all his people from the Euphrates River to the River of Egypt. [254] </v>
      <v n="13">
 Many of my people are now lost in Assyria. [255] Some of my people have run away to Egypt. But at that time, a great trumpet will be blown. And all those people will come back to Jerusalem. Those people will bow down before the Lord on that holy mountain. </v>
