 Every table is covered with vomit. There is not a clean place anywhere.
 </v>
      <v n="9">
 The Lord is trying to teach a lesson to the people. The Lord is trying to make the people understand his teachings. But the people are like little babies. They are like babies that were at their mother’s breast only a very short time ago. </v>
