 And I am calling a man from the east. That man will be like an eagle. He will come from a faraway country, and he will do the things I decide to do. I am telling you that I will do this, and I will do it. I made him, and I will bring him! </v>
      <v n="12">
 “Some of you think that you have great power—but you don’t do good things. Listen to me! </v>
