 </v>
      <v n="25">
 This message is from the Lord. “The time is coming when I will punish all the people that are circumcised [79] only in the body. </v>
      <v n="26">
 I am talking about the people of the nations of Egypt, Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab, and all the people that live in the desert. The men in all those countries really were not circumcised in their bodies. But the people from the family of Israel were not circumcised in their hearts.”
 </v>
