 The men from Anathoth were planning to kill Jeremiah. Those men said to Jeremiah, “Don’t prophesy [100] in the name of the Lord, or we will kill you.” The Lord made a decision about those men from Anathoth. </v>
      <v n="22">
 The Lord All-Powerful said, “I will soon punish those men from Anathoth. Their young men will die in war. Their sons and daughters will die from hunger. </v>
      <v n="23">
 No person from the city of Anathoth will be left. No person will survive. I will punish them. I will cause something bad to happen to them.” </v>
