      <v n="1">
 Then the Lord said to me again, “Gomer [24] has many lovers. But you must continue loving her. Why? Because that is like the Lord. The Lord continues loving the people of Israel. But they continue to worship other gods. And they love to eat raisin cakes.” [25] </v>
