 “Israel, you act like a prostitute. [44] But don’t let Judah be guilty. Don’t go to Gilgal [45] or go up to Beth-aven. [46] Don’t use the Lord’s name to make promises. Don’t say, ‘As the Lord lives …!’ </v>
