 But those people refused to listen.
They refused to do what he wanted.
They closed their ears so they
could not hear what God said.
 </v>
      <v n="12">
 They were very stubborn.
They would not obey the law.
The Lord All-Powerful used his Spirit
and sent messages to his people
through the prophets.
