 The Lord All-Powerful says, “You have special days of sadness and fasting in the fourth month, the fifth month, the seventh month, and the tenth month. [22] Those days of sadness must be changed into days of happiness. Those will be good and happy holidays. And you must love truth and peace!” </v>
