      <v n="11">
 {It will be like it was before, when God brought them out of Egypt.} He hit the sea waves, {the sea split,} and the people walked across that sea of troubles. The Lord will make the river streams become dry. He will destroy Assyria’s pride and Egypt’s power.) </v>
      <v n="12">
 The Lord will make his people strong. And they will live for him and his name. The Lord said these things. </v>
