 The Lord my God says, “Care for the sheep that have been raised to be killed. </v>
      <v n="5">
 {Their leaders are like owners and businessmen.} Owners kill their sheep and are not punished. Businessmen sell the sheep and say, ‘Praise the Lord, I am rich!’ The shepherds don’t feel sorry for their sheep. </v>
