 I fired the three shepherds all in one month. I became angry at the sheep, and they began to hate me. </v>
      <v n="9">
 Then I said, “I quit! I will not take care of you! I will let those that want to die, die. I will let those that want to be destroyed, be destroyed. And those that are left will destroy each other.” </v>
