 Then I said, “If you want to pay me, then pay me. If not, then don’t!” So they paid me 30 pieces of silver. </v>
      <v n="13">
 Then the Lord told me, “So that’s how much they think I’m worth. Throw that large amount of money [29] into the temple treasury.” So I took the 30 pieces of silver and threw them into the treasury at the Lord’s temple. </v>
      <v n="14">
 Then I cut the stick named Union into two pieces. I did this to show that the union between Judah and Israel had been broken. </v>
