 Then the Lord said to me, “Now, get the things a foolish shepherd might use. </v>
      <v n="16">
 This will show that I will get a new shepherd for this country. But this young man will not be able to take care of the sheep that are being destroyed. He will not be able to heal the hurt sheep. He will not be able to feed those that are left alive. And the healthy ones will be eaten completely—only their hoofs will be left.” </v>
