 Christ himself died for you. And that one death paid for your sins. He was not guilty, but he died for people who are guilty. He did this to bring you all to God. His body was killed, but he was made alive in the spirit. </v>
      <v n="19">
 And in the spirit he went and preached to the spirits in prison. </v>
      <v n="20">
