 That water is like baptism [26] that now saves you. Baptism is not the washing of dirt from the body. Baptism is asking God for a pure heart. It saves you because Jesus Christ was raised from death. </v>
      <v n="22">
 Now Jesus has gone into heaven. He is at God’s right side. He rules over angels, authorities, and powers. </v>
