      <v n="6">
 So be humble under God’s powerful hand. Then he will lift you up when the right time comes. </v>
      <v n="7">
 Give all your worries to him, because he cares for you. </v>
      <v n="8">
 Control yourselves and be careful! The devil is your enemy. And he goes around like a roaring lion looking for some person to eat. </v>
      <v n="9">
