      <v n="10">
 Yes, you will suffer for a short time. But after that, God will make everything right. He will make you strong. He will support you and keep you from falling. He is the God that gives all grace (kindness). He called you to share in his glory in Christ. That glory will continue forever. </v>
      <v n="11">
 All power is his forever and ever. Amen. </v>
      <v n="12">
 Silas will bring this letter to you. I know that he is a faithful brother {in Christ}. I wrote this short letter to encourage you. I wanted to tell you that this is the true grace (kindness) of God. Stand strong in that grace. </v>
      <v n="13">
 The church in Babylon [33] says hello to you. Those people were chosen the same as you. Mark, my son {in Christ}, also says hello. </v>
      <v n="14">
