  </b>
  <b n="2 Pedro">
    <c n="1">
      <v n="1">
 Greetings from Simon Peter, a servant and apostle [1] of Jesus Christ. </v>
      <v n="2">
 Grace (kindness) and peace be given to you more and more, because now you know God and Jesus our Lord. </v>
