 At that same time there was a great earthquake. One tenth of the city was destroyed. And 7,000 people were killed in the earthquake. The people that did not die were very afraid. They gave glory to the God of heaven. </v>
      <v n="14">
 The second great trouble is finished. The third great trouble is coming soon. </v>
      <v n="15">
 The seventh angel blew his trumpet. Then there were loud voices in heaven. The voices said: </v>
      <v n="16">
 Then the 24 elders [86] bowed down on their faces and worshiped God. These are the elders who sit on their thrones before God. </v>
      <v n="17">
 The elders said: </v>
