      <v n="13">
 This second animal does great miracles. [95] He even makes fire come down from heaven to earth while people are watching. </v>
      <v n="14">
 This second animal fools the people that live on the earth. He fools them by using the miracles that he has been given the power to do. He does these miracles to serve the first animal. The second animal ordered people to make an idol [96] to honor the first animal. This was the animal that was wounded by the sword but did not die. </v>
      <v n="15">
 The second animal was given power to give life to the idol of the first animal. Then the idol could speak and order all the people who did not worship it to be killed. </v>
